      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "PRIVILEGES AND IMMUNITIES OF PERSONS SERVING ON COMMITTEE OR PARTICIPATING IN WORK OF, OR PERFORMING MISSION ON BEHALF OF, INTERNATIONAL ORGANIZATION"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/31/eng@/~sched_5__part_II",
      "@type": "akn:part",
      "eli:number": "II",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/31/eng@/~sched_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "IMMUNITIES OF PERSON WHO HAS SERVED ON COMMITTEE OR PARTICIPATED IN WORK OF, OR PERFORMED MISSION ON BEHALF OF, INTERNATIONAL ORGANIZATION Immunity from suit and from other legal process in respect of acts and things done in serving on the committee, participating in the work or performing the mission. (PRIVILEGES AND IMMUNITIES)"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/31/eng@/~sched_5__part_I__para_1",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/31/eng@/~sched_5__part_I",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Immunity from personal arrest or detention."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/31/eng@/~sched_5__part_I__para_2",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/31/eng@/~sched_5__part_I",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Immunity from suit and from other legal process in respect of acts and things done in serving on the committee, participating in the work or performing the mission."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/31/eng@/~sched_5__part_I__para_3",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/31/eng@/~sched_5__part_I",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Inviolability of papers and documents."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/31/eng@/~sched_5__part_I__para_4",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/31/eng@/~sched_5__part_I",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The right, for the purpose of communicating with the organization, to use codes and to send and receive correspondence and other papers and documents by couriers or in sealed bags."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/31/eng@/~sched_5__part_I__para_5",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/31/eng@/~sched_5__part_I",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Exemption from currency or exchange restrictions to such extent as is accorded to a representative of a foreign government on a temporary mission on behalf of that government."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/31/eng@/~sched_5__part_I__para_6",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/31/eng@/~sched_5__part_I",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The like privileges and immunities in respect of personal baggage as are accorded to a head of mission."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/31/eng@/~sched_6",
      "@type": "akn:schedule",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/31/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "(Section 12) AMENDMENT OF THE DIPLOMATIC AND CONSULAR PRIVILEGES ORDINANCE 1957 Amendment Delete the definition of the words \"international organisation\". (1) In subsection (1), delete paragraph (b). (2) In subsection (2)— (a) delete the words \"or by an international organisation\"; (b) substitute for the words \"such sovereign, government or organisation\" wherever they appear the words \"such sovereign or government\"; (c) substitute for the words \"such sovereign, government, organisation or person\" the words \"such sovereign, government or person\"; (d) substitute for the words \"Land Code of the Federated Malay States or of any law relating to land corresponding thereto in force in any other State\" the words \"National Land Code\"; and (e) substitute for the marginal reference \"F.M.S. Cap. 138.\" the marginal reference \"561 1965.\". (3) In subsection (5)— (a) substitute for the words \"any sovereign, government or international organisation\" the words \"any sovereign or government\"; (b) substitute for the words \"such sovereign, government or organisation\" wherever they appear the words \"such sovereign or government\"; Amendment (c) substitute for the words \"Land Code of the Federated Malay States or of any law relating to land corresponding thereto in force in any State\" the words \"National Land Code or any law in force\"; and (d) substitute for the marginal reference ''F.M.S. Cap. 138.\" the marginal reference \"561 1965,\","
      }
    }
  ]
}
